You weren't taking big steps.

891
00:23:52,040 --> 00:23:52,840
It's okay.

892
00:23:52,840 --> 00:23:53,840
Kaiyi.

893
00:23:53,840 --> 00:23:55,920
Kaiyi, our legs got tangled.

894
00:23:56,240 --> 00:23:58,200
Should we go over and rescue them?

895
00:23:58,200 --> 00:23:58,720
Let's go.

896
00:23:58,720 --> 00:23:59,640
Come on.

897
00:23:59,640 --> 00:24:00,320
One, two.

898
00:24:01,500 --> 00:24:03,700
