900
00:24:06,080 --> 00:24:07,400
One, two.

901
00:24:07,400 --> 00:24:08,480
They're here to rub it in.

902
00:24:08,480 --> 00:24:10,440
One, two.

903
00:24:10,880 --> 00:24:11,800
Hello.

904
00:24:12,520 --> 00:24:14,800
Need some help?

905
