907
00:24:17,120 --> 00:24:17,800
Give them a break.

908
00:24:17,800 --> 00:24:19,040
Need some help, kids?

909
00:24:23,280 --> 00:24:24,600
Whoever unties first gets first pick.

910
00:24:24,600 --> 00:24:25,600
First pick.

911
00:24:25,600 --> 00:24:26,520
Okay.

912
00:24:30,920 --> 00:24:32,640
Okay.

913
00:24:32,640 --> 00:24:35,400
This one's good.

914
00:24:40,780 --> 00:24:41,820
(First to grab a badminton racket)

915
