917
00:24:45,960 --> 00:24:47,040
We already have a winner.

918
00:24:47,040 --> 00:24:47,520
You know?

919
00:24:51,000 --> 00:24:52,640
Two of them are still tied together.

920
00:24:52,960 --> 00:24:53,760
It's a tight knot.

921
00:24:54,720 --> 00:24:55,920
Take your time.

922
00:24:56,760 --> 00:24:57,880
I know.

923
00:24:58,640 --> 00:24:59,920
Yeah, right here.

924
00:25:01,840 --> 00:25:04,560
The Matchmaking God's
tied these two together.

925
00:25:04,560 --> 00:25:05,880
Actually, I kinda don't wanna untie it.

926
00:25:06,920 --> 00:25:07,840
Here we go.

927
00:25:08,200 --> 00:25:09,440
Tied together by fate.

928
00:25:10,960 --> 00:25:12,200
Put those back.

929
00:25:12,200 --> 00:25:13,400
Ref, what's wrong with you?

930
00:25:13,400 --> 00:25:14,080
Alright.

931
00:25:14,080 --> 00:25:15,280
What kind of ref are you?

932
00:25:15,280 --> 00:25:17,160
