Okay, so we get to pick our rackets first.

937
00:25:26,640 --> 00:25:27,160
Pick.

938
00:25:27,160 --> 00:25:28,080
Come on, guys.

939
00:25:28,080 --> 00:25:29,400
Let's enjoy our victory.

940
00:25:29,400 --> 00:25:31,040
You don't have
to pick a badminton racket.

941
00:25:31,040 --> 00:25:32,400
Yeah, challenge yourselves.

942
