944
00:25:34,760 --> 00:25:36,500
(Badminton basin)

945
00:25:36,760 --> 00:25:37,680
I don't care.

946
00:25:37,840 --> 00:25:39,340
(Not falling for it)
Not listening.

947
00:25:39,360 --> 00:25:40,240
Not listening.

948
00:25:40,840 --> 00:25:41,400
Nope.

949
00:25:42,640 --> 00:25:44,040
I think this one's pretty good.

950
00:25:44,040 --> 00:25:44,600
Seriously.

951
00:25:44,600 --> 00:25:46,500
