979
00:26:26,080 --> 00:26:27,670
(Hahaha)
Ready to serve.

980
00:26:27,720 --> 00:26:29,500
Feeling cooler?

981
00:26:29,500 --> 00:26:32,680
(Fanning with a spatula)

982
00:26:32,680 --> 00:26:34,600
You can use this as a mirror.

983
00:26:40,160 --> 00:26:40,920
Then forget the wok.

984
00:26:40,920 --> 00:26:42,040
We're good with these.

985
00:26:42,480 --> 00:26:43,840
Come on, let's go.

986
00:26:44,720 --> 00:26:45,480
Show us.

987
00:26:45,600 --> 00:26:46,400
Show us.

988
00:26:46,400 --> 00:26:47,080
(Rackets selected)

989
00:26:47,080 --> 00:26:47,680
This is hilarious.

990
00:26:47,680 --> 00:26:48,360
Here comes the kitchen crew.

991
00:26:48,360 --> 00:26:49,040
The kitchen crew.

992
00:26:49,480 --> 00:26:49,920
What do you wanna eat?

993
00:26:49,920 --> 00:26:50,880
I'll whip up a few dishes later.

994
00:26:51,080 --> 00:26:51,880
Sounds good.

995
00:26:52,080 --> 00:26:53,840
The losing team has to eat lemons.

996
00:26:53,840 --> 00:26:55,280
