Are we playing one-on-one or...

997
00:26:55,400 --> 00:26:56,400
We can do one-on-one

998
00:26:56,400 --> 00:26:57,480
and two-on-two. How's that?

999
00:26:57,480 --> 00:26:58,280
Sure.

1000
00:26:58,280 --> 00:26:58,680
That works.

1001
00:26:58,680 --> 00:26:58,960
Okay.

1002
00:26:58,960 --> 00:26:59,480
Team matches.

1003
00:26:59,480 --> 00:27:01,000
One-on-one, two-on-two, three-on-three.

1004
00:27:01,080 --> 00:27:02,040
So, one-on-one first?

1005
00:27:02,040 --> 00:27:02,560
Okay.

1006
00:27:02,760 --> 00:27:04,520
Captain, pick your matchups wisely.

1007
00:27:05,080 --> 00:27:06,200
Definitely Hewen.

1008
00:27:06,200 --> 00:27:06,800
Wait, this...

1009
00:27:06,800 --> 00:27:08,080
Hewen, will that work?

1010
00:27:08,080 --> 00:27:09,120
It's a bit light. Let me try that.

1011
00:27:09,120 --> 00:27:10,040
Here. This one's good.

1012
00:27:10,040 --> 00:27:11,240
This one's good.

1013
00:27:11,240 --> 00:27:11,840
Can you even play with this?

1014
00:27:11,840 --> 00:27:12,720
