I really feel bad about this.

1028
00:27:27,960 --> 00:27:29,120
This just feels so unfair.

1029
00:27:29,120 --> 00:27:30,940
(Look at him)

1030
00:27:31,480 --> 00:27:32,360
Look at his...

1031
00:27:32,800 --> 00:27:33,720
Have we won already?

1032
00:27:34,080 --> 00:27:35,400
You've gotta win with that.

1033
00:27:35,400 --> 00:27:36,240
Let's pick that side.

1034
00:27:36,240 --> 00:27:38,280
