You'd better win, Cui.

1035
00:27:38,280 --> 00:27:39,360
We'll take that side.

1036
00:27:39,360 --> 00:27:40,080
The wind's in our favor here.

1037
00:27:40,080 --> 00:27:41,360
Wait, the winners get to pick.

1038
00:27:41,360 --> 00:27:42,720
Go on.

1039
00:27:42,720 --> 00:27:44,040
(Every advantage unlocked)
We've gotta win, Cui.

1040
00:27:44,040 --> 00:27:44,920
This...

1041
00:27:44,920 --> 00:27:45,920
We believe in you.

1042
00:27:45,920 --> 00:27:47,120
If I still lose this, I'll be so embarrassed.

1043
00:27:47,120 --> 00:27:48,600
You can do it. We believe in you.

1044
00:27:49,120 --> 00:27:49,840
Seven points.

1045
00:27:49,840 --> 00:27:51,060
