Seven.

1046
00:27:51,680 --> 00:27:52,660
(Hewen vs. Yihang)
Let's start.

1047
00:27:52,680 --> 00:27:53,520
Are we starting?

1048
00:27:53,520 --> 00:27:54,000
We're starting.

1049
00:27:54,000 --> 00:27:54,310
Okay.

1050
00:28:01,080 --> 00:28:01,840
Cui.

1051
00:28:01,840 --> 00:28:02,680
Hewen.

1052
00:28:10,900 --> 00:28:12,140
