1053
00:28:18,800 --> 00:28:19,920
Cui.

1054
00:28:19,920 --> 00:28:20,760
No.

1055
00:28:20,760 --> 00:28:21,360
Stop clapping.

1056
00:28:21,360 --> 00:28:22,240
I almost feel bad.

1057
00:28:22,240 --> 00:28:22,840
So bad.

1058
00:28:24,240 --> 00:28:24,960
One to zero.

1059
00:28:25,280 --> 00:28:27,200
