You can switch rackets once during the match.

1060
00:28:27,360 --> 00:28:28,320
Go ahead. Switch anytime.

1061
00:28:28,320 --> 00:28:29,240
You can even switch twice.

1062
00:28:29,240 --> 00:28:30,040
Even twice.

1063
00:28:32,360 --> 00:28:33,560
Seriously, he's hilarious.

1064
00:28:35,740 --> 00:28:37,180
(Serving from the other side)

1065
00:28:40,260 --> 00:28:41,740
(Can't even clear the net)

1066
00:28:41,780 --> 00:28:42,960
(Hewen 0:2 Yihang)

1067
00:28:42,960 --> 00:28:43,760
I'm dying.

1068
00:28:46,240 --> 00:28:47,920
Doesn't your hand hurt from hitting it?

1069
00:28:48,800 --> 00:28:49,680
The serve didn't go over.

1070
00:28:50,320 --> 00:28:51,040
Two to zero.

1071
00:28:52,360 --> 00:28:52,960
Serve again.

1072
00:28:53,240 --> 00:28:53,920
I'll give it another serve.

1073
00:28:53,920 --> 00:28:54,640
I'm still getting used to it.

1074
00:28:54,640 --> 00:28:55,400
Give him one.

1075
00:28:55,400 --> 00:28:59,380
(Hewen 0:1 Yihang)

1076
00:29:02,080 --> 00:29:02,680
Come on.

1077
00:29:03,500 --> 00:29:04,380
(Still using backhand)

1078
00:29:04,720 --> 00:29:05,520
Come on.

1079
00:29:05,780 --> 00:29:07,340
(Doesn't clear the net)

1080
00:29:07,420 --> 00:29:12,660
(Hewen 0:2 Yihang)

1081
00:29:12,680 --> 00:29:13,160
Tell them to stop clapping.

1082
00:29:13,160 --> 00:29:13,920
This isn't a fair win.

1083
00:29:13,920 --> 00:29:14,520
I wanna switch to the fan.

1084
00:29:14,520 --> 00:29:15,480
I'll try the fan.

1085
00:29:15,760 --> 00:29:16,920
If you switch to the fan,

1086
00:29:16,920 --> 00:29:17,800
