No, I didn't.

1135
00:31:33,440 --> 00:31:35,360
You can't reuse a badminton racket.

1136
00:31:35,360 --> 00:31:37,480
(One badminton racket is now off-limits)
No reusing rackets.

1137
00:31:37,640 --> 00:31:38,920
We still have another racket.

1138
00:31:38,920 --> 00:31:40,660
We have two.

1139
00:31:40,660 --> 00:31:41,880
(One more left)
We have two.

1140
00:31:42,840 --> 00:31:43,520
Once you've used one,

1141
00:31:43,520 --> 00:31:44,520
you can use the other.

1142
00:31:44,520 --> 00:31:45,960
You just can't reuse them.

1143
00:31:46,200 --> 00:31:48,680
If we win the two-on-two,

1144
00:31:48,680 --> 00:31:49,660
