1183
00:32:45,080 --> 00:32:45,880
We have to win.

1184
00:32:45,880 --> 00:32:46,480
We really do.

1185
00:32:46,480 --> 00:32:47,440
Seriously.

1186
00:32:47,440 --> 00:32:48,280
If we lose this round,

1187
