1188
00:32:50,840 --> 00:32:51,600
Let's go.

1189
00:32:51,600 --> 00:32:52,120
Come on.

1190
00:32:52,120 --> 00:32:52,560
Let's go.

1191
00:32:52,840 --> 00:32:53,200
Come on.

1192
00:32:53,440 --> 00:32:55,000
Don't say we bullied you when we win.

1193
00:32:55,640 --> 00:32:56,680
We're done going easy on you.

1194
00:32:56,680 --> 00:32:57,120
Okay.

1195
00:32:57,640 --> 00:32:58,280
Bring it on.

1196
00:32:58,480 --> 00:32:59,480
