1207
00:33:22,280 --> 00:33:22,800
It's okay.

1208
00:33:22,800 --> 00:33:23,640
Zero to one.

1209
00:33:24,280 --> 00:33:24,960
We'll give them one.

1210
00:33:24,960 --> 00:33:25,440
Give them one.

1211
00:33:25,440 --> 00:33:26,480
We'll let you have this round.

1212
00:33:26,480 --> 00:33:26,920
It's okay.

1213
00:33:27,240 --> 00:33:28,500
