1221
00:33:55,220 --> 00:34:02,900
(Bohan & Yiheng 1:2 Yue'er & Xiaoyu)

1222
00:34:05,340 --> 00:34:06,040
(Bohan & Yiheng 1:3 Yue'er & Xiaoyu)

1223
00:34:06,040 --> 00:34:06,600
