Nice shot.

1224
00:34:06,600 --> 00:34:07,440
We won.

1225
00:34:09,120 --> 00:34:10,520
What do we do now?

1226
00:34:12,380 --> 00:34:13,100
(Easy return)

1227
00:34:13,120 --> 00:34:13,680
Nice shot.

1228
00:34:17,020 --> 00:34:17,660
(Lands perfectly)

1229
00:34:17,660 --> 00:34:19,560
(Bohan & Yiheng 1:4 Yue'er & Xiaoyu)

1230
00:34:19,560 --> 00:34:20,280
It's four to one.

1231
00:34:20,280 --> 00:34:21,600
Four to one.

1232
00:34:23,280 --> 00:34:24,000
It's four to one already?

1233
00:34:24,440 --> 00:34:25,200
It's okay.

1234
00:34:25,440 --> 00:34:25,760
It's okay.

1235
00:34:25,960 --> 00:34:27,600
