Don't say we bullied you when we win.

1236
00:34:32,120 --> 00:34:33,960
I don't even need to be here.

1237
00:34:34,200 --> 00:34:35,320
We're done going easy on you.

1238
00:34:37,200 --> 00:34:37,840
