1242
00:34:52,180 --> 00:34:53,580
(Bohan & Yiheng 1:5 Yue'er & Xiaoyu)

1243
00:34:53,600 --> 00:34:54,560
It's five to one.

1244
00:34:54,980 --> 00:34:55,800
