1245
00:34:55,800 --> 00:34:56,960
What do we do?

1246
00:34:59,760 --> 00:35:00,960
I don't even have to play.

1247
00:35:00,960 --> 00:35:01,760
I don't have to play.

1248
00:35:01,760 --> 00:35:02,840
