I can't either.

1303
00:36:43,360 --> 00:36:44,400
Meng, can you?

1304
00:36:44,400 --> 00:36:45,280
Nope.

1305
00:36:45,280 --> 00:36:45,900
(Can't serve)

1306
00:36:46,180 --> 00:36:47,660
