1314
00:37:07,700 --> 00:37:08,460
(Misses)

1315
00:37:09,660 --> 00:37:13,140
(Xing, Meng & Kaiyi 0:3
Si, Fang & Yu Yang)

1316
00:37:13,160 --> 00:37:13,800
Three to zero.

1317
00:37:16,480 --> 00:37:17,640
Beautiful form.

1318
00:37:18,160 --> 00:37:19,440
At least the form was beautiful.

1319
00:37:21,400 --> 00:37:22,400
We can scoop it up.

1320
00:37:22,400 --> 00:37:23,740
