1380
00:39:19,720 --> 00:39:20,520
It's fine.

1381
00:39:25,340 --> 00:39:26,540
(Xing, Meng & Kaiyi 1:6 Si,
Fang & Yu Yang)

1382
00:39:26,560 --> 00:39:27,000
Yes.

1383
