1401
00:40:09,000 --> 00:40:09,520
Impressive.

1402
00:40:09,520 --> 00:40:10,520
We did our best.

1403
00:40:10,800 --> 00:40:11,480
We sure did.

1404
00:40:12,160 --> 00:40:13,160
That was fun.

1405
00:40:13,960 --> 00:40:14,880
Alright, that's it.

1406
00:40:15,320 --> 00:40:16,160
That was incredible.

1407
00:40:16,360 --> 00:40:17,400
Okay, we lost again.

1408
00:40:17,400 --> 00:40:18,480
