1413
00:40:24,840 --> 00:40:25,600
I love them.

1414
00:40:25,600 --> 00:40:26,240
Really?

1415
00:40:26,240 --> 00:40:26,800
I do.

1416
00:40:27,200 --> 00:40:28,200
