Anyone else want yogurt?

1677
00:48:39,280 --> 00:48:40,120
I'll have one.

1678
00:48:40,120 --> 00:48:41,720
This'll be my third one.

1679
00:48:41,720 --> 00:48:42,560
Thanks.

1680
00:48:44,400 --> 00:48:45,160
I'll give it to Yu Yang.

1681
00:48:45,160 --> 00:48:46,240
I'll just share his.

1682
00:48:46,240 --> 00:48:47,380
(Not that I want any)

1683
00:48:47,520 --> 00:48:48,320
Xiaoyu.

1684
00:48:48,560 --> 00:48:49,360
Thanks.

1685
00:48:50,680 --> 00:48:51,720
I'll leave two here for you.

1686
00:48:51,720 --> 00:48:53,520
I'll put the rest over there.

1687
00:48:53,880 --> 00:48:54,640
Then I'll take another.

1688
00:48:54,640 --> 00:48:55,560
Meng, one more for me.

1689
00:48:55,680 --> 00:48:56,120
Okay.

1690
00:48:56,520 --> 00:48:57,480
Yue'er, want some?

1691
00:48:57,880 --> 00:48:58,320
Yes.

1692
00:48:58,320 --> 00:48:59,000
Thanks.

1693
00:48:59,000 --> 00:48:59,520
I don't need one.

1694
00:48:59,520 --> 00:49:00,280
I'm good.

1695
00:49:00,280 --> 00:49:01,200
Give it to them.

1696
00:49:01,200 --> 00:49:02,000
We'll share this one.

1697
00:49:02,000 --> 00:49:02,600
You're sharing one?

1698
00:49:02,600 --> 00:49:03,520
Yeah, give it to them.

1699
00:49:03,800 --> 00:49:04,720
Who wants yogurt?

1700
00:49:07,740 --> 00:49:08,400
(Helping hand out yogurt)

1701
00:49:08,400 --> 00:49:09,480
